{
  "total_seconds": 69.727,
  "fps": 30,
  "total_frames": 2092,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line_index": 0,
      "text": "Over a million pints of beer once tore through London in a fifteen-foot tidal wave.",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 4.133875
    },
    {
      "line_index": 1,
      "text": "It's 1814, and the Horse Shoe Brewery just finished its pride and joy: a fermentation tank the size of a three-story house.",
      "start": 4.583875,
      "end": 11.503041666666666
    },
    {
      "line_index": 2,
      "text": "Twenty-two feet of solid oak, clamped together by twenty-nine massive iron hoops.",
      "start": 11.803041666666667,
      "end": 15.604958333333334
    },
    {
      "line_index": 3,
      "text": "At four o'clock, a warehouse clerk notices a seven-hundred-pound iron ring has fallen off.",
      "start": 16.054958333333335,
      "end": 20.258000000000003
    },
    {
      "line_index": 4,
      "text": "His boss tells him not to worry\u2014rings slip all the time, just leave a note to fix it later.",
      "start": 20.558000000000003,
      "end": 24.84779166666667
    },
    {
      "line_index": 5,
      "text": "Inside, thirty-five hundred barrels of dark porter are fermenting, building up pressure like a giant shaken soda bottle.",
      "start": 25.14779166666667,
      "end": 30.350375000000003
    },
    {
      "line_index": 6,
      "text": "With one ring gone, the rest have to carry the load.",
      "start": 30.650375000000004,
      "end": 32.86920833333334
    },
    {
      "line_index": 7,
      "text": "They start creaking, stretching, and bulging.",
      "start": 33.16920833333334,
      "end": 34.997375000000005
    },
    {
      "line_index": 8,
      "text": "Then the bottom ring snaps like a cannon shot, the oak walls blow out, and the shockwave ruptures three more vats.",
      "start": 35.44737500000001,
      "end": 40.29908333333334
    },
    {
      "line_index": 9,
      "text": "A three-hundred-thousand-gallon tidal wave of beer blasts through the brick wall into the street.",
      "start": 40.59908333333334,
      "end": 44.455291666666675
    },
    {
      "line_index": 10,
      "text": "Luckily, the streets were flooded with free beer.",
      "start": 44.90529166666668,
      "end": 46.85091666666668
    },
    {
      "line_index": 11,
      "text": "Unluckily, the wave was fifteen feet tall and moving at thirty miles an hour.",
      "start": 47.150916666666674,
      "end": 50.57566666666668
    },
    {
      "line_index": 12,
      "text": "Locals rushed outside with pots, kettles, and teacups, scooping up pints straight from the road.",
      "start": 51.02566666666668,
      "end": 55.03216666666668
    },
    {
      "line_index": 13,
      "text": "In court, a judge officially ruled the flood an 'Act of God', and Parliament even gave the brewery a tax refund for the lost alcohol.",
      "start": 55.33216666666668,
      "end": 61.509250000000016
    },
    {
      "line_index": 14,
      "text": "It ended giant wooden vats forever, forcing breweries to switch to steel.",
      "start": 61.80925000000001,
      "end": 65.10529166666667
    },
    {
      "line_index": 15,
      "text": "So if you ever see a seven-hundred-pound metal ring pop off a barrel, maybe don't just leave a note.",
      "start": 65.40529166666667,
      "end": 69.42720833333334
    }
  ],
